CHAPTER III-OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
8. Officers of the University.-The following shall be the officers
of the University, namely :-
(i) the Chancellor ;
(ii') the Pro-Chancellor;
(iii) the Rector ;
(iv) the President;
(v) the Directors-General of Academies ;
(vi) the Vice-Presidents) ;
(vii) the Deans ;
(viii) the Directors ; and
(ix) such other persons as may be prescribed by Regulations to be
the officers.

